    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schematica is an action roguelike where every block has a function. Walls are walls. Bombs are bombs. Hearts are hearts. Enemies are made of them. The world is made of them. You and your bullet are made of them. Shoot your way through the world, collect new blocks and craft the perfect build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your own survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Schematica, you don't choose a character - you <strong>build</strong> one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/8d468413e546f51c616705366b7ad9a1.webp?t=1747244509\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Health pixels keep you <strong>alive</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/87b91a40fc74f9039e74507915179aba.webp?t=1747244509\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Speed pixels make you <strong>faster</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/2641907723ff6acea680fde273cc1ccd.webp?t=1747244509\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Bomb pixels <strong>explode</strong> on impact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/71277cad48b8c7227b0629c4f26bcefd.webp?t=1747244509\" width=32 height=32 /></span>...and cooler ones you'll have to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies adapt. So should you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies aren\u2019t just sponges. They ram, flank, snipe, and evolve.<br>You\u2019ll need to <strong>rebuild</strong>, use smarter pixels, and outmaneuver chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/dba124344a5049d31b1d8c1d1b07bdce.poster.avif?t=1747244509\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/dba124344a5049d31b1d8c1d1b07bdce.webm?t=1747244509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/dba124344a5049d31b1d8c1d1b07bdce.mp4?t=1747244509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot it. Mine it. Slot it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, crack open chests and reforge your layout.<br>No two runs are the same, and if you\u2019re lucky, you\u2019ll find rare-tier tiles that change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/586b27d911de4b79f13ab9ae20f7d6fe.poster.avif?t=1747244509\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/586b27d911de4b79f13ab9ae20f7d6fe.webm?t=1747244509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/586b27d911de4b79f13ab9ae20f7d6fe.mp4?t=1747244509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goal?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the <strong>final pixel</strong> in the exit room.<br>You\u2019ll know it when you see it. Getting there\u2019s the hard part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/18050548e1c5e0c50c552b0a032cc174.poster.avif?t=1747244509\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/18050548e1c5e0c50c552b0a032cc174.webm?t=1747244509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725600/extras/18050548e1c5e0c50c552b0a032cc174.mp4?t=1747244509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
